<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1032271610"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:43.507"><div begin="46.505" end="1:13.266" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="46.505" end="52.201" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.505" end="47.929">雨都停了</span> <span begin="48.490" end="49.582">这片天</span><span begin="50.162" end="51.012">灰什么</span><span begin="51.012" end="52.201">呢</span></p><p begin="53.703" end="59.143" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.703" end="54.911">我还记得</span> <span begin="55.573" end="56.331">你说</span><span begin="56.331" end="57.103">我们</span><span begin="57.103" end="57.763">要快</span><span begin="57.763" end="59.143">乐</span></p><p begin="1:00.789" end="1:06.161" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.789" end="1:02.132">深夜里的</span><span begin="1:02.694" end="1:03.846">脚步声</span><span begin="1:04.280" end="1:04.818">总是</span><span begin="1:04.818" end="1:06.161">刺耳</span></p><p begin="1:06.258" end="1:13.266" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.258" end="1:07.134">害怕</span><span begin="1:07.134" end="1:08.010">寂寞</span> <span begin="1:08.093" end="1:08.799">就让</span><span begin="1:08.799" end="1:09.469">狂欢</span><span begin="1:09.782" end="1:10.487">的</span><span begin="1:10.487" end="1:11.240">城市</span><span begin="1:11.240" end="1:11.803">陪我</span><span begin="1:11.803" end="1:13.266">关灯</span></p></div><div begin="1:13.820" end="1:26.912" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:13.820" end="1:17.075" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.820" end="1:15.185">只是哪怕周围</span><span begin="1:15.185" end="1:15.990">再多</span><span begin="1:15.990" end="1:17.075">人</span></p><p begin="1:17.837" end="1:20.699" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.837" end="1:18.791">感觉还是</span><span begin="1:18.791" end="1:19.530">一个</span><span begin="1:19.530" end="1:20.699">人</span></p><p begin="1:21.001" end="1:26.912" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.001" end="1:22.583">每当我笑了</span> <span 