23">的</span><span begin="1:56.800" end="1:57.648">心</span><span begin="1:57.648" end="1:59.099">里</span></p></div><div begin="2:12.526" end="2:39.597" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:12.526" end="2:19.374" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.526" end="2:13.808">当我走在</span><span begin="2:14.126" end="2:15.656">去过的</span><span begin="2:15.950" end="2:16.802">每个地</span><span begin="2:16.802" end="2:19.374">方</span></p><p begin="2:19.672" end="2:25.777" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.672" end="2:20.893">总会听到</span><span begin="2:21.321" end="2:22.269">你那</span><span begin="2:22.269" end="2:23.352">最自由</span><span begin="2:23.625" end="2:24.048">的</span><span begin="2:24.048" end="2:25.777">笑</span></p><p begin="2:26.879" end="2:32.189" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.879" end="2:27.941">当我回到</span><span begin="2:28.547" end="2:29.849">一个人</span><span begin="2:30.240" end="2:30.625">住的</span><span begin="2:30.625" end="2:30.914">地</span><span begin="2:30.914" end="2:32.189">方</span></p><p begin="2:32.199" end="2:39.597" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.199" end="2:33.432">最怕看到</span><span begin="2:33.838" end="2:35.038">冬天你</span><span begin="2:35.167" end="2:36.279">最爱穿</span><span begin="2:36.279" end="2:36.732">的</span><span begin="2:36.732" end="2:37.809">那件</span><span begin="2:37.809" end="2:38.281">外</span><span begin="2:38.281" end="2:39.597">套</span></p></div><div begin="2:39.824" end="2:53.136" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="2:39.824" end="2:43.400" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.824" end="2:40.287">只是</span><span begin="2:40.287" end="2:40.963">哪怕周围</span><span begin="2:41.119" end="2:41.602">再多</span><span begin="2:41.901" end="2:43.400">人</span></p><p begin="2:43.783" end="2:46.795" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.783" end="2:44.581">感觉还是</span><span begin="2:44.822" end="2:45.571">一个</span><span begin="2:45.571" end="2:46.795">人</span></p><p b